    rdfs:label "subsessile"^^xsd:string ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An attachment quality inhering in a plant structure by virtue of its being attached by a very short stalk, so that it is almost sessile."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0001435 (attachment quality), added 2026-10-06 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: subsessile (14)). Candidate for submission to PATO."@en ;
